  "statement": "Suppose that we have a rooted tree T with vertices 1, \\ldots, n. We construct an undirected ancestor graph G of T with the same set of vertices. A pair of distinct vertices v, u is adjacent in G if and only if v is an ancestor of u in T, or vice versa. You are given a graph G with n vertices.",
